SEC. 51P-859.114. NOTICE.

Within five days of filing any application for a (a) change in zoning district classification or boundary; (b) development plan; (c) landscape plan; (d) site plan; (e) amendment, including a minor amendment, to an approved development plan, site plan, or landscape plan; (f) variance or special exception; (g) or permit issued by the Texas Alcoholic Beverage Commission, the applicant or Property owner must mail a copy of the application and any plans to the designated representatives, at an address provided by the Department of Sustainable Development and Construction, of the:

(1) Junius Heights Historic District Association;

(2) Munger Place Historic District Association;

(3) Peak’s Addition Homeowner’s Association; and

(4) Swiss Avenue Historic District Association. (Ord. 28362)
